  "faq": [
    {
      "question": "What does a marker bounty Bounty Marker from Bain’s Gold (Dead or Alive) do?",
      "answer": "A Bounty Marker doesn’t do anything by itself. If Bain’s enemy is defeated that round, they spend an additional life counter (and return the Marker). At the end of the round, the Bounty Marker is returned. If Bain is defeated, the Marker is not returned.",
      "source": "goa2-faq"
    }
  ],
  "lore": "I wouldn't go around asking questions about Bain. Shady character, that one. Some say he is a nobleman looking for his lost sister, some say he is just an ordinary drunk. Drunk or not, he is the best shot this side of the desert. Unless you want him for a job, stay clear of him, partner!",
